==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|lactatio|lactātiō, lactātiōnis}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|en|lactate|ion}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/lækˈteɪʃən/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-lactation.wav|Audio (southern England)}}
* {{rhymes|en|eɪʃən|s=3}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The {{l|en|secretion}} of {{l|en|milk#Noun}} from the [[mammary gland]] of a [[female]] [[mammal]].
# The process of providing the milk to the young; [[breastfeeding]].
# The [[period]] of time that a mother lactates to feed her young; '''lactation''' period.

